Prerequisites
Python 3.8+

The art library

Install dependencies using pip:

Bash
pip install art
Note: tkinter comes pre-installed with standard Python distributions on Windows and macOS. If you are on Linux, you may need to install it via your package manager:

Bash
sudo apt-get install python3-tk
How to Run
Clone this repository or copy the script file:

Bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ascii-art-studio.git
cd ascii-art-studio
Run the Python application:

Bash
python main.py
Usage
Enter Text: Input the word or phrase you want to convert into the TEXT INPUT box.

Select Font: Choose a font from the FONT SELECTION dropdown.

Choose Platform: Select where you plan to paste your ASCII art (WhatsApp, Instagram, X (Twitter), or Discord).

Copy Output: Click 📋 Copy Output to copy the formatted text directly to your clipboard.
